  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "If the gears will not turn",
      "text": [
        "A first layer squashed too hard can bridge the gaps at the bottom. Slide a thin blade round the base of each gear, then try again. The gaps are drawn for 0.20 mm layers: do not print the gear set at another layer height."
      ]
